(6953407, 1047697, 153814, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing it''s about exercise.<br/>I''m sure 100 people are going to tell you that you forgot the title.<br/>I like the composition alot and the motion shown with the runner.<br/>One of my top picks. Well done</td>', 'I''m guessing it''s about exercise.I''m sure 100 people are going to tell you that you forgot the title.I like the composition alot and the motion shown with the runner.One of my top picks. Well done', '2013-01-09 07:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953408, 1048601, 70661, '<td valign="top">Looks like you found some! Love the texture and the soft colors.</td>', 'Looks like you found some! Love the texture and the soft colors.', '2013-01-09 07:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953409, 1048250, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like this. Very different!</td>', 'I like this. Very different!', '2013-01-09 07:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953412, 1048549, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very creative, well done.</td>', 'Very creative, well done.', '2013-01-09 08:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953413, 1048616, 49109, '<td valign="top">Good, simple idea, like the background; shot could have been enhanced with a vertical crop, deeper DOF and a second, dim light or reflector from the left.</td>', 'Good, simple idea, like the background; shot could have been enhanced with a vertical crop, deeper DOF and a second, dim light or reflector from the left.', '2013-01-09 08:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953414, 1048606, 49109, '<td valign="top">Looks like a classic shoehorn to me; without the title there''d be no connection to the challenge topic. As a portrait not too bad; however, I find the crop a little too close and it seems a lot of softening has been applied.</td>', 'Looks like a classic shoehorn to me; without the title there''d be no connection to the challenge topic. As a portrait not too bad; however, I find the crop a little too close and it seems a lot of softening has been applied.', '2013-01-09 08:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953415, 1048612, 49109, '<td valign="top">great shot and also kind of a one step tutorial. The connection to the challenge is quite loose, though.</td>', 'great shot and also kind of a one step tutorial. The connection to the challenge is quite loose, though.', '2013-01-09 08:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953420, 1048135, 49109, '<td valign="top">The best so far. Excellent lighting and comp. This must be shot by a brass instrument player :)</td>', 'The best so far. Excellent lighting and comp. This must be shot by a brass instrument player :)', '2013-01-09 08:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953432, 1048473, 92577, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendering of this view</td>', 'Beautiful rendering of this view', '2013-01-09 08:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953434, 1048575, 92577, '<td valign="top">Good idea and to know what they are is maybe enough</td>', 'Good idea and to know what they are is maybe enough', '2013-01-09 08:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953441, 1048617, 92577, '<td valign="top">A great doggy shot</td>', 'A great doggy shot', '2013-01-09 09:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953443, 1048622, 92577, '<td valign="top">We should buy shares in those companies. Some people still believe you can buy a dream. :-)</td>', 'We should buy shares in those companies. Some people still believe you can buy a dream. :-)', '2013-01-09 09:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953461, 1048618, 141542, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re going with the composition, and the juxtaposition of a variety of shapes is a good idea, but the execution leaves something to be desired.<br/> <br/>The objects lack the clarity and texture I''d expect to see in this context, the background elements are present enough to be distracting, and the perspective itself seems a bit odd.</td>', 'I see where you''re going with the composition, and the juxtaposition of a variety of shapes is a good idea, but the execution leaves something to be desired. The objects lack the clarity and texture I''d expect to see in this context, the background elements are present enough to be distracting, and the perspective itself seems a bit odd.', '2013-01-09 10:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953463, 1048379, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, the bird is well positioned and the balance between the branches in the foreground and background is excellent.  My only qualm is that there appears to be some sort of artefacts on the bird''s head.  <br/> <br/>Good image.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, the bird is well positioned and the balance between the branches in the foreground and background is excellent.  My only qualm is that there appears to be some sort of artefacts on the bird''s head.   Good image.', '2013-01-09 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953464, 1048564, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but photographically/artistically it''s not very captivating.</td>', 'I like the idea, but photographically/artistically it''s not very captivating.', '2013-01-09 10:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953465, 1048546, 141542, '<td valign="top">The lighting could be a bit better I think, but this is excellent!</td>', 'The lighting could be a bit better I think, but this is excellent!', '2013-01-09 10:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953467, 1048559, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I wish the other eye was present.  Nice all the same.</td>', 'I like this, but I wish the other eye was present.  Nice all the same.', '2013-01-09 10:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953470, 1048037, 141542, '<td valign="top">Not incredibly interesting, but it''s a pleasant image.</td>', 'Not incredibly interesting, but it''s a pleasant image.', '2013-01-09 10:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953472, 1047937, 141542, '<td valign="top">I think this would''ve made a great B&amp;W image, had it not been overtaken by the texture/noise/whatever that is.</td>', 'I think this would''ve made a great B&W image, had it not been overtaken by the texture/noise/whatever that is.', '2013-01-09 10:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953475, 1048609, 141542, '<td valign="top">Good!  I love the very soft shadow, oddly enough, and I think it''s a huge part of making this image what it is.  The shoe''s well defined shadow slowly becoming this amorphous blob as it makes its way up the subject''s body is very interesting.<br/> <br/>I enjoyed your new trial for sure!</td>', 'Good!  I love the very soft shadow, oddly enough, and I think it''s a huge part of making this image what it is.  The shoe''s well defined shadow slowly becoming this amorphous blob as it makes its way up the subject''s body is very interesting. I enjoyed your new trial for sure!', '2013-01-09 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953477, 1048626, 141542, '<td valign="top">Certainly lovely from where you were standing, but the perspective and distracting elements detract from what you could have conveyed as a very special scene.<br/> <br/>I just didn''t get taken anywhere with this image.</td>', 'Certainly lovely from where you were standing, but the perspective and distracting elements detract from what you could have conveyed as a very special scene. I just didn''t get taken anywhere with this image.', '2013-01-09 10:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953478, 1047989, 141542, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Bonus points for adventures in technology.</td>', 'Cool!  Bonus points for adventures in technology.', '2013-01-09 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953479, 1048058, 141542, '<td valign="top">I laughed, and therefore this shot is a success!</td>', 'I laughed, and therefore this shot is a success!', '2013-01-09 10:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953480, 1047951, 141542, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Well composed, interesting photograph.  Composition could probably be moved right and down very slightly to include the whole tray, and, while that is a nitpick, I think the image would be improved a bit.</td>', 'Love the title.  Well composed, interesting photograph.  Composition could probably be moved right and down very slightly to include the whole tray, and, while that is a nitpick, I think the image would be improved a bit.', '2013-01-09 10:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953482, 1048125, 141542, '<td valign="top">Excellent tone, and the background and foreground play very well together.  The title is a little odd, but I guess you had something in mind and I won''t knock you for it.  Good image.</td>', 'Excellent tone, and the background and foreground play very well together.  The title is a little odd, but I guess you had something in mind and I won''t knock you for it.  Good image.', '2013-01-09 10:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953485, 1047647, 141542, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I think a time lapse of the ''second'' hand moving around the watch would have been pretty cool!</td>', 'Nice composition. I think a time lapse of the ''second'' hand moving around the watch would have been pretty cool!', '2013-01-09 10:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953486, 1048541, 141542, '<td valign="top">Composition seems a little off, but this is a lovely image of your father, and I do like your tones/lighting.</td>', 'Composition seems a little off, but this is a lovely image of your father, and I do like your tones/lighting.', '2013-01-09 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953487, 1048495, 141542, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I care for the vignette, but this is excellent all the same.  Well captured.</td>', 'Not sure if I care for the vignette, but this is excellent all the same.  Well captured.', '2013-01-09 10:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953489, 1047699, 141542, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the resolution is here, and the photo just isn''t very attractive to me.</td>', 'Not sure what the resolution is here, and the photo just isn''t very attractive to me.', '2013-01-09 10:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953491, 1048496, 141542, '<td valign="top">Nature gave you a lovely opportunity here, but I don''t think it was taken advantage of to the fullest extent.</td>', 'Nature gave you a lovely opportunity here, but I don''t think it was taken advantage of to the fullest extent.', '2013-01-09 10:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953492, 1048536, 141542, '<td valign="top">Superb.  The photojournalistic style appeals to me, and this is just perfectly hilarious.  Very well done.</td>', 'Superb.  The photojournalistic style appeals to me, and this is just perfectly hilarious.  Very well done.', '2013-01-09 10:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953494, 1048105, 141542, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Alignment of the fork and knife seems a little off.  No big deal, still a quality image.</td>', 'Very nice.  Alignment of the fork and knife seems a little off.  No big deal, still a quality image.', '2013-01-09 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953495, 1048289, 141542, '<td valign="top">Good street. Foreground body is a little distracting to me, but the light coming in is lovely.  <br/> <br/>Excellent eye.</td>', 'Good street. Foreground body is a little distracting to me, but the light coming in is lovely.   Excellent eye.', '2013-01-09 10:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953499, 1048063, 141542, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but too much going on in the image, light isn''t used well really since I''ve got a whole blackboard (or whatever it is) visible in the background, some obtrusive shadows, and a generally ''amateur'' feel to the image.  Nothing wrong with being inexperienced, but I''m not going to give you points for it!<br/> <br/>Good effort all the same, and keep working at it.  Without trial, and inevitable error, we''d never get any better!</td>', 'Cool idea, but too much going on in the image, light isn''t used well really since I''ve got a whole blackboard (or whatever it is) visible in the background, some obtrusive shadows, and a generally ''amateur'' feel to the image.  Nothing wrong with being inexperienced, but I''m not going to give you points for it! Good effort all the same, and keep working at it.  Without trial, and inevitable error, we''d never get any better!', '2013-01-09 10:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953500, 1048601, 141542, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Oil-like textures and a superb composition.</td>', 'Lovely.  Oil-like textures and a superb composition.', '2013-01-09 10:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953501, 1048540, 141542, '<td valign="top">If they''re all like this he better start paying you!  Excellent image!</td>', 'If they''re all like this he better start paying you!  Excellent image!', '2013-01-09 10:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953502, 1048575, 141542, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to think of this image.  I want to like it.  It feels good to me.  At the same time, I feel like I have focal point but don''t.  We''re braeking the laws of having one item in focus at least, and I kind of enjoy that.<br/> <br/>Conflicted about this, but I''m going to go with a higher score.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to think of this image.  I want to like it.  It feels good to me.  At the same time, I feel like I have focal point but don''t.  We''re braeking the laws of having one item in focus at least, and I kind of enjoy that. Conflicted about this, but I''m going to go with a higher score.', '2013-01-09 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953503, 1048596, 141542, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the object on the left is very distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice, but the object on the left is very distracting to me.', '2013-01-09 10:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6953504, 1048065, 141542, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Good shot.</td>', 'Funny.  Good shot.', '2013-01-09 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
