(6957101, 1048606, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s a good one. I really enjoyed that when I did the 365 project a few years ago.</td>', 'Oh, that''s a good one. I really enjoyed that when I did the 365 project a few years ago.', '2013-01-14 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957105, 1048541, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a great resolution and a great photo to accompany it.</td>', 'That''s a great resolution and a great photo to accompany it.', '2013-01-14 10:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957106, 1048616, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great take on the standard resolution.</td>', 'Great take on the standard resolution.', '2013-01-14 10:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957109, 1048118, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, a powerful image.</td>', 'Wow, a powerful image.', '2013-01-14 10:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957110, 1048572, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a gorgeous industrial photo. Great use of long exposure, depth, reflections. Just everything is spot on.</td>', 'Wow, that is a gorgeous industrial photo. Great use of long exposure, depth, reflections. Just everything is spot on.', '2013-01-14 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957111, 1048573, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea. I think I would like it a bit better if the front most piece was in focus, but it''s still good.</td>', 'This is a cool idea. I think I would like it a bit better if the front most piece was in focus, but it''s still good.', '2013-01-14 11:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957112, 1048220, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the deep blacks of the unknown ahead.</td>', 'I like the deep blacks of the unknown ahead.', '2013-01-14 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957113, 1048564, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ha, lovely idea! Great socks!</td>', 'Ha, lovely idea! Great socks!', '2013-01-14 11:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957114, 1048576, 23921, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a bit more light on the face vs on the neck. Face looks plain and my eyes are taking me to the neck and hands where you can see more light.</td>', 'Would like to see a bit more light on the face vs on the neck. Face looks plain and my eyes are taking me to the neck and hands where you can see more light.', '2013-01-14 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957115, 1048235, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a great resolution, and one that I should take up.</td>', 'That''s a great resolution, and one that I should take up.', '2013-01-14 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957116, 1048495, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo of a great time in a kid''s life.</td>', 'Lovely photo of a great time in a kid''s life.', '2013-01-14 11:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957117, 1048549, 114225, '<td valign="top">How did you manage this without getting the camera in the reflection? Nicely done!</td>', 'How did you manage this without getting the camera in the reflection? Nicely done!', '2013-01-14 11:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957120, 1048618, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The image seems to lack sharpness that could really make it pop.</td>', 'I like the idea. The image seems to lack sharpness that could really make it pop.', '2013-01-14 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957121, 1048617, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love it. The bokeh and light going down indicating you are playing fetch late into the evening is a great thing.</td>', 'Love it. The bokeh and light going down indicating you are playing fetch late into the evening is a great thing.', '2013-01-14 11:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957122, 1048561, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good thing this is a photography site, or your title could land you in some hot water :)</td>', 'Good thing this is a photography site, or your title could land you in some hot water :)', '2013-01-14 11:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957123, 1048250, 114225, '<td valign="top">Another fantastic image.</td>', 'Another fantastic image.', '2013-01-14 11:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957124, 1048619, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.</td>', 'Great use of light.', '2013-01-14 11:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957126, 1048058, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love this idea!</td>', 'Love this idea!', '2013-01-14 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957127, 1048286, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a precious photo. Love how the colors all jive.</td>', 'What a precious photo. Love how the colors all jive.', '2013-01-14 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957128, 1048135, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very busy, but at the same time clean. I like it.</td>', 'Very busy, but at the same time clean. I like it.', '2013-01-14 11:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957129, 1047951, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hahah! Love the idea. But hate the fact that you are making me want donuts.</td>', 'Hahah! Love the idea. But hate the fact that you are making me want donuts.', '2013-01-14 11:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957131, 1047989, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a scene. The color balance is perfect.</td>', 'Wow, what a scene. The color balance is perfect.', '2013-01-14 11:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957410, 1048541, 114285, '<td valign="top">good idea, I like this, just a little dark on one side of his face though!</td>', 'good idea, I like this, just a little dark on one side of his face though!', '2013-01-14 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957533, 1048065, 23098, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and selective color</td>', 'I really like the composition and selective color', '2013-01-14 21:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957616, 1047989, 136989, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.  Beautiful and on point with the challenge.  I love the detail in the leaves.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.  Beautiful and on point with the challenge.  I love the detail in the leaves.', '2013-01-14 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957617, 1048485, 136989, '<td valign="top">Very nice... love the sky. I really like how the posts on the right look a bit like people walking.</td>', 'Very nice... love the sky. I really like how the posts on the right look a bit like people walking.', '2013-01-14 23:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957622, 1048606, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, beautiful child!</td>', 'Lovely portrait, beautiful child!', '2013-01-14 23:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957641, 1048572, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Amazing that something so industrial can look so fairyland pretty. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Amazing that something so industrial can look so fairyland pretty. 10', '2013-01-15 00:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957682, 1048105, 152252, '<td valign="top">I love that it''s so close to symmetry. Nice color accents. Please don''t starve though :)</td>', 'I love that it''s so close to symmetry. Nice color accents. Please don''t starve though :)', '2013-01-15 01:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957683, 1048559, 152252, '<td valign="top">For some reason it reminded me of some of Steve McCurry''s street portraits. A portrait that kind of brings us closer to the subject. Great light (love how you showed the wrinkles and the eye). Nice textures on the hat and face. Great job!</td>', 'For some reason it reminded me of some of Steve McCurry''s street portraits. A portrait that kind of brings us closer to the subject. Great light (love how you showed the wrinkles and the eye). Nice textures on the hat and face. Great job!', '2013-01-15 01:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957923, 1048288, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow...those out stretched wings, against that sky.  Beautifully done!</td>', 'Wow...those out stretched wings, against that sky.  Beautifully done!', '2013-01-15 10:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957928, 1048573, 68947, '<td valign="top">Awww :)</td>', 'Awww :)', '2013-01-15 11:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957960, 1048118, 101702, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cassandra_(Doctor_Who)" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lady Cassandra</a> though looking at what appears to be the artists initials and date on the corner, this would pre-date Doctor Who... Maybe that''s where they got the idea from!</td>', 'Reminds me of Lady Cassandra though looking at what appears to be the artists initials and date on the corner, this would pre-date Doctor Who... Maybe that''s where they got the idea from!', '2013-01-15 11:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957970, 1048250, 152252, '<td valign="top">Samantha? :) Probably the most creative entry. Very good light. The eye and lips look great. Love the reflection and the feeling of symmetry. Lovely!</td>', 'Samantha? :) Probably the most creative entry. Very good light. The eye and lips look great. Love the reflection and the feeling of symmetry. Lovely!', '2013-01-15 12:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957974, 1048541, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, I like the lighting in his hair. Very thoughtful pose. Is Mark your father?</td>', 'Nice portrait, I like the lighting in his hair. Very thoughtful pose. Is Mark your father?', '2013-01-15 12:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957975, 1048541, 152252, '<td valign="top">That''s an amazing portrait. The light is great and shows all the wrinkles. The expression on his face looks very realistic (reminds me of people with dementia or Alzheimer''s but I hope that''s not the case :( One of my top three in the challenge. Great resolution too. All the best to you and your father!</td>', 'That''s an amazing portrait. The light is great and shows all the wrinkles. The expression on his face looks very realistic (reminds me of people with dementia or Alzheimer''s but I hope that''s not the case :( One of my top three in the challenge. Great resolution too. All the best to you and your father!', '2013-01-15 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957987, 1048135, 69246, '<td valign="top">Nice one peter. I see you have the 1 1/4 on there. :) Is that Arbans? :)</td>', 'Nice one peter. I see you have the 1 1/4 on there. :) Is that Arbans? :)', '2013-01-15 12:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
