(6958774, 1048554, 96509, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and votes. A bit more time on the processing on some defined direction might have helped the score, couldn''t decide some parts were too dark or too bright. Maybe better light adding some artificial to the natural lighting, but wasn''t very keen in re-shooting due to obvious reasons. Thanks to <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1181721" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Team Elysium</a> (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tommy_Mac</a>, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=12611" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">blindjustice</a>, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=18197" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Dr.Confuser</a>, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=93809" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">fngood83</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=109387" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Alexkc</a>) for the suggestions on this shoot.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and votes. A bit more time on the processing on some defined direction might have helped the score, couldn''t decide some parts were too dark or too bright. Maybe better light adding some artificial to the natural lighting, but wasn''t very keen in re-shooting due to obvious reasons. Thanks to Team Elysium ( Tommy_Mac,  blindjustice,  Dr.Confuser,  fngood83 and  Alexkc) for the suggestions on this shoot.', '2013-01-16 08:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
