(6958837, 1048561, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, definitely scored too low, I think the dissonance between it and the other entries hurt the score - not quite what the voter was looking for this time around. I love that the tone of the image fits the subject, just as the tone of some of your antique-y shots add so much to the picture, same here, except that the tone is very bright, in-your-face, unusual, attention-grabbing, PR centric, etc. ''Tis a magnificent image, ''tis, ''tis!</td>', 'Beautiful photo, definitely scored too low, I think the dissonance between it and the other entries hurt the score - not quite what the voter was looking for this time around. I love that the tone of the image fits the subject, just as the tone of some of your antique-y shots add so much to the picture, same here, except that the tone is very bright, in-your-face, unusual, attention-grabbing, PR centric, etc. ''Tis a magnificent image, ''tis, ''tis!', '2013-01-16 09:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
