(6960280, 1048167, 108580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scooter97:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a very dynamic BIF shot. Who knows why it didn''t score higher. This deserved a better finish. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Because there are 10 people (3''s and 4''s) who don''t recognise the technical skill of this type of work or are vying for percentile placing improvements of their own shot. That''s my opinion and I''m sticking to it :) eg: Once I gave out my 7''s, 8''s and 9''s I did not adjust them down because I was averaging 6.4 in the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-01-18 03:23:40.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by scooter97: It''s a very dynamic BIF shot. Who knows why it didn''t score higher. This deserved a better finish.  Because there are 10 people (3''s and 4''s) who don''t recognise the technical skill of this type of work or are vying for percentile placing improvements of their own shot. That''s my opinion and I''m sticking to it :) eg: Once I gave out my 7''s, 8''s and 9''s I did not adjust them down because I was averaging 6.4 in the challenge.', '2013-01-18 01:34:15.000000', '2013-01-18 03:23:40.000000', 0),
